Troubleshooting Tips
Service won't start:

# Check logs
sudo tail -f /var/log/clickhouse-server/clickhouse-server.log

# Check port availability
sudo netstat -tlnp | grep 9000
Connection refused:

# Verify service status
sudo service clickhouse-server status

# Restart if needed
sudo service clickhouse-server restart
Query errors:

Verify table names and column names match exactly (case-sensitive)
Check data types in INSERT statements
Ensure all required columns are included
Performance issues:

Verify ORDER BY clause matches query patterns
Check if indexes are being used: EXPLAIN SELECT ...
Consider using PREWHERE for filtering before aggregation
